  "FLINK-29319": {
    "jira_id": "FLINK-29319",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "Upgrade Calcite version to 1.32",
    "description": "{code}\r\nThis release fixes CVE-2022-39135, an XML External Entity (XEE) vulnerability that allows a SQL query to read the contents of files via the SQL functions EXISTS_NODE, EXTRACT_XML, XML_TRANSFORM or EXTRACT_VALUE.\r\n\r\nComing 1 month after 1.31.0 with 19 issues fixed by 17 contributors, this release also replaces the ESRI spatial engine with JTS and proj4j, adds 65 spatial SQL functions including ST_Centroid, ST_Covers and ST_GeomFromGeoJSON, adds the CHAR SQL function, and improves the return type of the ARRAY and MULTISET functions.{code}",
    "commits": [
      {
